# Companion environment template.
# The desktop app does not read a model API key.
# Demo mode needs no variables.
#
# The assistant proxy holds the model key. Run it with:
#   ASSISTANT_API_KEY=... npm run assistant-proxy
# Optional: ASSISTANT_UPSTREAM_URL, ASSISTANT_MODEL, PORT, COMPANION_PROXY_TOKEN.
# Point Companion's cloud setting at http://127.0.0.1:8787 after you accept the disclosure.
# COMPANION_PROXY_TOKEN, if set, is a server password. It is not the model key.
#
# Paid agent smoke (proxy turn only):
#   COMPANION_AGENT_SMOKE=1 ASSISTANT_API_KEY=... COMPANION_AGENT_MODEL=... npm test -- apps/desktop/tests/agentTurn.test.ts
#
# Real-LLM multi-task Agent Browser benchmark (uses AuthorizedToolExecutor + Playwright fixtures):
#   COMPANION_BROWSER_LLM_BENCHMARK=1 ASSISTANT_API_KEY=... COMPANION_AGENT_MODEL=... \
#     npx vitest run apps/desktop/tests/browserLlmBenchmark.test.ts
# Report: /tmp/companion-browser-llm-benchmark.json (path may vary by OS tmpdir).
